{"src":"en","tgt":"zh","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"zh","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7719.977623,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":8610.839063,"text":"如果你看过电影《国家宝藏》，你可能会认为《独立宣言》的背面写着一张藏宝图。"},{"kind":"audio","t":8726.718810999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8731.721379999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8737.136722,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8742.510084000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8747.980676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8751.473139000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"audio","t":8751.974091,"samples":9792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":13883.021976,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14618.847974,"text":"这款热巧克力达到了比利时标准。果汁很贵，但过一会儿，你就能品尝到它的甜味。"},{"kind":"audio","t":14743.072837,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14748.43361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14753.841831999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14759.315273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14764.720995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14769.412859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":14769.815461999999,"samples":16992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":22221.071221,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":22886.972084999998,"text":"然而，事实并非如此。虽然文件的背面确实写了一些东西，但它并不是一张藏宝图。"},{"kind":"audio","t":23009.289868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23014.70691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23020.018562999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23025.382215999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23030.66607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23036.073223,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23036.491845999997,"samples":25392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":29989.832781999998,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":30940.581909,"text":"您可能还希望咨询除本国以外的其他政府的建议，但他们的建议是为本国公民设计的。"},{"kind":"audio","t":31063.61785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31068.746917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31074.173529,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31079.600111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31085.059731999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31090.575263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31091.803973,"samples":30792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":41297.147855999996,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42038.692611,"text":"香港岛赋予了香港这个地名，也是许多游客将其视为核心关注的地方。"},{"kind":"audio","t":42159.832353,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42165.201886,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42170.594789,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42176.125039,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42181.405643,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42183.076845999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"audio","t":42183.373561,"samples":792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":49104.87471,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50119.79608,"text":"任何将在高温纬度地区或翻越山隘驾驶的人，都应考虑到出现雪、冰或结冰的可能性。"},{"kind":"audio","t":50243.51726,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50248.533298,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":50253.803572,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50259.4237,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50264.732273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50270.338152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50274.081550999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"audio","t":50274.401055,"samples":10624,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":58792.043871,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59492.361418,"text":"分离与重组使变异在两个基因库之间来回交替。"},{"kind":"audio","t":59608.205066,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59613.552519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59618.947271,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":59623.121403,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":59623.453017,"samples":13528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":61184.047278,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61385.724835,"text":"每一代。"},{"kind":"audio","t":61489.787535999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":61490.20068,"samples":20632,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":66512.14716800001,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67576.08901800001,"text":"昆虫学家在正式语境中使用“半翅目昆虫”（bug）一词来指代这一类昆虫。"},{"kind":"audio","t":67693.98513300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67695.56877700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67697.03323300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67698.634477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67700.61094500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67701.146856,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"audio","t":67701.44766100001,"samples":1392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":74697.725445,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75564.936337,"text":"首先，大多数骑手穿着带有鞋跟且鞋底平滑且相当窄的骑马靴。"},{"kind":"audio","t":75679.04937400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75684.331577,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75689.54202200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75694.90308500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75700.08043,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75701.45656800001,"samples":31760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":83917.663715,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":84857.066357,"text":"该委员会是马尔泰利针对十月开始的广泛反政权抗议活动所做出的回应。"},{"kind":"audio","t":84978.703832,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84984.225602,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84989.59860400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84995.01805500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85000.36596800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85002.981085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"audio","t":85003.28035,"samples":4992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":91141.42221500001,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":91836.050824,"text":"消防救援人员最终在晚上11点35分扑灭了大火。"},{"kind":"audio","t":91951.48416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91956.94663,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91962.252974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91967.459359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91967.936841,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":97371.644927,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98063.898585,"text":"大西洋飓风季中令人紧张的亚热带风暴杰瑞，"},{"kind":"audio","t":98177.14776600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98182.731834,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98187.869321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98190.307591,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"audio","t":98190.600926,"samples":2728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":100227.15743600001,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100530.825178,"text":"于今日在大西洋形成。"},{"kind":"audio","t":100636.87031700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100642.091901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":100642.458725,"samples":22064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":107240.140727,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":107773.236543,"text":"它促使我们去训练汽车以及许多其他交通设备。"},{"kind":"audio","t":107888.080088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107893.534379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":107899.01533000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107903.340869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":107903.676714,"samples":14728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116620.033305,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117482.1208,"text":"它以奢侈中心的地位而闻名，始于公元400年左右，并持续到..."},{"kind":"audio","t":117602.57368300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117607.816288,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117612.98405300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117618.283767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":117622.41467900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":117622.78135300001,"samples":14360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":120745.80575500001,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121161.057965,"text":"直到公元1100年左右。"},{"kind":"audio","t":121255.30721700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121256.903691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":121257.25911500001,"samples":25064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":127070.31362700001,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127589.706347,"text":"月球表面由岩石和尘埃组成。月球的外层被称为地壳。"},{"kind":"audio","t":127704.67638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127706.305693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127707.661141,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127709.350844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127709.83149600001,"samples":29128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":134214.057264,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135045.98504099998,"text":"美国陆军工程兵团估计，6英寸的降雨量可能会冲破此前受损的"},{"kind":"audio","t":135161.505305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135163.113559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":135164.50081599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135166.19373899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135167.758753,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":135168.094448,"samples":23960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":141190.41568399998,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":141995.824294,"text":"特别是，有人声称通过正确解读微表情，可以检测出一个人是否在撒谎。"},{"kind":"audio","t":142117.36581,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142122.455367,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142127.843609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142133.29788899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142138.711671,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142140.807917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"audio","t":142141.062883,"samples":2592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147237.21323,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":147967.31875,"text":"请勿在建筑结构上涂鸦或刻划，以免破坏场地面貌。"},{"kind":"audio","t":148085.305933,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148090.549168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148096.119977,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148101.344801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148101.773994,"samples":25528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":154875.376424,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":155855.272356,"text":"老虎的吼叫不像狮子那样浑厚，而更像是一串低吼且大声的词句。"},{"kind":"audio","t":155975.153848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155980.353174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155985.66854699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155991.112168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155996.439421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":155996.816135,"samples":22760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":161914.699676,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":162684.13653299998,"text":"20世纪的研究表明，遗传变异存在两个库：隐藏的和表达的。"},{"kind":"audio","t":162804.086415,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162809.751953,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162815.036166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162821.118707,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162824.048869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"audio","t":162824.372384,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":173105.828821,"code":1005}]}